{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Tate不动点"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Tate 不动点"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>参考 "},{"Local":{"url":"NikolausScholzeTCH","text":"Nikolaus–Scholze"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>定义 Tate 不动点为如下余纤维:\n$$\r\nX^{tC_p} := \\operatorname{cofib}(X_{hC_p} \\overset{\\mathrm{Nm}}{\\to} X^{hC_p}).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Tate对角线","text":"Tate 对角线"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}